SoLouder is an altered Rust port of the SoLoud audio engine. It is not the
original SoLoud and is not affiliated with or endorsed by its authors.

SoLouder is distributed under the same zlib/libpng license as SoLoud proper.
Third-party code ported alongside SoLoud keeps its own notice; see
THIRD_PARTY.md.

